#: cli/doctor.php
#, php-format
msgid "Available repairs: %s"
msgstr "Hagaajinnada la heli karo: %s"

#: cli/doctor.php
#, php-format
msgid "Unknown format %s. Use text, json, nagios, or prometheus."
msgstr "Qaab aan la aqoon %s. Isticmaal text, json, nagios, ama prometheus."

#: cli/doctor.php
#, php-format
msgid "Redaction could not complete, so %s was not written."
msgstr "Qarinta xogta xasaasiga ah way dhammaystirmi wayday, sidaas darteed %s lama qorin."

#: cli/doctor.php
#, php-format
msgid "Wrote %s. Review it before sharing; values after password, secret, token, and community names are masked."
msgstr "Waxaa la qoray %s. Dib u eeg ka hor intaadan wadaagin; qiimayaasha ka dambeeya erayada sirta ah (password), secret, token, iyo magacyada community waa la qariyay."

#: cli/doctor.php doctor_functions.php
msgid "Unknown repair"
msgstr "Hagaajin aan la aqoon"

#: cli/doctor.php
msgid "Refusing to repair without --yes."
msgstr "Waa la diiday in la hagaajiyo iyadoo aan la isticmaalin --yes."

#: cli/doctor.php
msgid "Select a supported symptom and text or JSON output."
msgstr "Dooro astaan la taageero iyo soo-saar text ama JSON ah."

#: cli/doctor.php doctor_web.php
msgid "Accepted warning"
msgstr "Digniin la aqbalay"

#: doctor_access.php doctor_functions.php
msgid "Device availability"
msgstr "Helitaanka qalabka"

#: doctor_access.php
msgid "Device permissions could not be evaluated."
msgstr "Ogolaanshooyinka qalabka lama qiimayn karin."

#: doctor_access.php
msgid "The configured PHP CLI cannot run Doctor checks."
msgstr "PHP CLI-ga la habeeyay ma wadi karo hubinnada Doctor."

#: doctor_access.php
msgid "Doctor checks failed or exceeded their time limit. Review the Doctor log."
msgstr "Hubinnada Doctor way fashilmeen ama waxay dhaafeen waqtigoodii xaddidnaa. Dib u eeg diiwaanka Doctor."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Graphs stopped updating"
msgstr "Jaantusyadu way joojiyeen cusboonaysiinta"

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Polling is slow"
msgstr "Xog-ururintu way gaabis tahay"

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Devices are missing or unavailable"
msgstr "Qalabku waa maqan yahay ama lama heli karo"

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Doctor alerts are missing"
msgstr "Digniinaha Doctor way maqan yihiin"

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Check the poller scheduler and the affected poller log, then verify a new completed cycle."
msgstr "Hubi jadwalka poller-ka iyo diiwaanka poller-ka ay saameysay, ka dibna xaqiiji wareeg cusub oo dhammaaday."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Collection may have stopped."
msgstr "Ururinta xogta waxaa laga yaabaa inay joogsatay."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Collected values may not be reaching disk."
msgstr "Qiimaha la ururiyay waxaa laga yaabaa inaysan gaarin saxanka."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Inspect the output queue and Boost flush history; verify that the queue drains and RRD timestamps advance."
msgstr "Baadh safka wax-soo-saarka iyo taariikhda nadiifinta Boost; xaqiiji in safku faaruqmayo iyo in waqtiyada RRD ay hore u socdaan."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Check storage capacity, runtime-directory permissions and the last RRD update; account for deferred writes."
msgstr "Hubi awoodda kaydinta, ogolaanshaha galka hawlgalka iyo cusboonaysiintii u dambeysay ee RRD; tixgeli qoraallada dib loo dhigay."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "RRD storage needs investigation."
msgstr "Kaydinta RRD waxay u baahan tahay baaritaan."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Collection work may be exceeding its time budget."
msgstr "Shaqada ururinta waxaa laga yaabaa inay dhaafayso miisaaniyadda waqtigeeda."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Compare cycle duration with the polling interval and inspect device timeouts before increasing concurrency."
msgstr "Isbarbardhig muddada wareegga iyo muddada u dhexeysa ururinta, oo baadh waqti-dhammaadka qalabka ka hor inta aanad kordhin isku-mar-shaqeynta."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Compare database counters during a slow cycle and inspect query plans before changing server limits."
msgstr "Isbarbardhig tiriyayaasha xog-ururinta inta lagu jiro wareeg gaabis ah oo baadh qorshooyinka weydiinta ka hor inta aanad beddelin xadka server-ka."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Database pressure may be contributing to slow polling."
msgstr "Cadaadiska xog-ururinta waxaa laga yaabaa inuu qayb ka yahay gaabiska ururinta."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Collection prerequisites or reachability may be failing."
msgstr "Shuruudaha ururinta ama gaaritaanka shabakadda waxaa laga yaabaa inay fashilmayaan."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Verify the affected device permissions, reachability, credentials and assigned poller using Cacti diagnostics."
msgstr "Xaqiiji ogolaanshaha qalabka ay saameysay, gaaritaankiisa, aqoonsiyada gelitaanka, iyo poller-ka loo qoondeeyay adigoo adeegsanaya baaritaanka Cacti."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Scheduled checks or mail delivery need attention."
msgstr "Hubinta jadwalsan ama dirista emaylka waxay u baahan yihiin fiiro gaar ah."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Verify scheduling and recipient settings, inspect retained delivery attempts, and send a Cacti test email."
msgstr "Xaqiiji dejinta jadwalka iyo qaataha, baadh isku-dayada dirista ee la hayo, oo dir emayl tijaabo ah oo Cacti ah."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Possible causes require verification; matching checks do not establish a root cause."
msgstr "Sababaha suurtogalka ah waxay u baahan yihiin xaqiijin; hubinta iswaafaqsan ma caddeyneyso sababta asalka ah."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "No cause is established by the available observations. Run fresh diagnostics and investigate the symptom directly."
msgstr "Ma jirto sabab ay caddeeyeen indha-indheynta la heli karo. Samee baaritaan cusub oo si toos ah u baadh astaanta."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "At least 24 hours since server startup and FLUSH STATUS. Counters are cumulative and may have different reset histories; confirm trends during a representative workload before tuning."
msgstr "Ugu yaraan 24 saacadood laga bilaabo bilowga server-ka iyo FLUSH STATUS. Tiriyayaashu waa kuwo isbiirsada oo yeelan kara taariikho dib-u-dejin oo kala duwan; xaqiiji isbeddellada inta lagu jiro culays shaqo oo matalaad leh ka hor hagaajinta."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Cumulative tuning advice is deferred: obtain valid uptime and at least 24 hours since startup and FLUSH STATUS. Missing metrics or an inconsistent sample cannot establish database health."
msgstr "Talada hagaajinta ee isbiirsata dib baa loo dhigay: hel waqti-shaqeyn ansax ah iyo ugu yaraan 24 saacadood laga bilaabo bilowga iyo FLUSH STATUS. Cabiraado maqan ama muunad aan joogto ahayn ma xaqiijin karaan caafimaadka xog-ururinta."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Database observation window"
msgstr "Daaqadda indha-indheynta xog-ururinta"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Connection metrics are unavailable or invalid. Check access to SHOW GLOBAL STATUS and SHOW GLOBAL VARIABLES; do not treat missing metrics as an idle server."
msgstr "Cabiraadaha isku xirka lama heli karo ama waa kuwo aan ansax ahayn. Hubi gelitaanka SHOW GLOBAL STATUS iyo SHOW GLOBAL VARIABLES; ha u qaadan cabiraadaha maqan sidii server fadhiya."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Current connections: %.0f / %.0f (%s); recorded peak: %.0f (%s of the current limit)."
msgstr "Isku xirka hadda: %.0f / %.0f (%s); heerkii ugu sarreeyay ee la diiwaangeliyay: %.0f (%s xadka hadda)."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review connection pooling and poller concurrency. Check database-host memory headroom before raising max_connections; the historical peak may reflect an older limit."
msgstr "Dib u eeg wadaagga isku xirka iyo isku-mar-shaqeynta poller-ka. Hubi bannaanida xusuusta ee martigeliyaha xog-ururinta ka hor inta aanad kordhin max_connections; heerkii ugu sarreeyay ee taariikhiga ah wuxuu muujin karaa xad hore."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Connection capacity"
msgstr "Awoodda isku xirka"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "InnoDB buffer pool reads"
msgstr "Akhriska barkadda kaydka InnoDB"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review query plans and the working set. Consider innodb_buffer_pool_size only after measuring memory available on the database host; a cumulative miss ratio alone does not prove memory pressure."
msgstr "Dib u eeg qorshooyinka weydiinta iyo xogta lagu shaqeynayo. Tixgeli innodb_buffer_pool_size kaliya ka dib marka la cabbiro xusuusta laga heli karo martigeliyaha xog-ururinta; saamiga seegista isbiirsata keligeed ma caddayneyso cadaadis xusuuseed."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "On-disk temporary tables"
msgstr "Jadwallada ku-meel-gaarka ah ee saxanka ku jira"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review query plans, sorting, grouping, and temporary-table data types before changing memory limits. Some tables must use disk; memory limits and accounting differ between MySQL and MariaDB versions."
msgstr "Dib u eeg qorshooyinka weydiinta, kala-soocidda, kooxeynta, iyo noocyada xogta ee jadwallada ku-meel-gaarka ah ka hor inta aanad beddelin xadka xusuusta. Jadwallada qaar waa inay adeegsadaan saxanka; xadka xusuusta iyo xisaabinta way ku kala duwan yihiin noocyada MySQL iyo MariaDB."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Connection thread creation"
msgstr "Abuurista dunta isku xirka"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review connection reuse and thread_cache_size. Check the server thread-handling mode before tuning; thread-pool implementations do not behave like one-thread-per-connection servers."
msgstr "Dib u eeg dib-u-isticmaalka isku xirka iyo thread_cache_size. Hubi habka maaraynta dunta ee server-ka ka hor hagaajinta; hababka barkadda dunta uma dhaqmaan sida server-rada hal-dun-isku-xirkiiba ah."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review slow-query logging, long_query_time, and query plans before changing server buffers. This counter depends on the configured slow-query threshold and does not identify individual statements."
msgstr "Dib u eeg diiwaangelinta weydiinaha gaabiska ah, long_query_time, iyo qorshooyinka weydiinta ka hor inta aanad beddelin kaydka server-ka. Tiriyahani wuxuu ku xiran yahay xadka weydiinta gaabiska ah ee la dejiyay mana aqoonsado weedhaha gaarka ah."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Slow statements"
msgstr "Weedho gaabis ah"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Cumulative advice deferred until the observation window is sufficient."
msgstr "Talada isbiirsata dib baa loo dhigay ilaa daaqadda indha-indheyntu ku filnaato."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Thread-cache advice is not assessed: thread_handling is unavailable or is not one-thread-per-connection. Review the active thread-pool implementation instead."
msgstr "Talada kaydka dunta lama qiimeyn: thread_handling lama heli karo ama ma aha hal-dun-isku-xirkiiba. Beddelkeeda dib u eeg hirgelinta barkadda dunta ee firfircoon."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Required counters are missing or invalid: %s, %s. Check server-version support and monitoring permissions."
msgstr "Tiriyayaasha loo baahan yahay way maqan yihiin ama waa kuwo aan ansax ahayn: %s, %s. Hubi taageerada nooca server-ka iyo ogolaanshaha kormeerka."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "A counter reset since the prior sample; collect another representative interval before tuning."
msgstr "Tiriye ayaa dib loo dejiyay tan iyo muunaddii hore; ururi muddo kale oo matalaad leh ka hor hagaajinta."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Insufficient activity: %.0f %s; at least %d observations are needed for this advisory."
msgstr "Hawl aan ku filnayn: %.0f %s; ugu yaraan %d indha-indheyn ayaa looga baahan yahay taladan."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Counters are inconsistent or were reset independently. Collect a new representative sample before tuning."
msgstr "Tiriyayaashu isma waafaqsana ama si madax-bannaan ayaa dib loogu dejiyay. Ururi muunad cusub oo matalaad leh ka hor hagaajinta."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The interval sample is too small or counters reset; collect another representative interval before tuning."
msgstr "Muunadda muddadu aad bay u yar tahay ama tiriyayaasha ayaa dib loo dejiyay; ururi muddo kale oo matalaad leh ka hor hagaajinta."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Interval %s / %s: %.0f / %.0f (%s); investigation threshold: %s."
msgstr "Muddada %s / %s: %.0f / %.0f (%s); xadka baaritaanka: %s."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Cumulative %s / %s: %.0f / %.0f (%s); investigation threshold: %s."
msgstr "Isbiirsiga %s / %s: %.0f / %.0f (%s); xadka baaritaanka: %s."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "This counter can omit memory-mapped temporary files on MySQL; a low ratio does not rule out disk use."
msgstr "Tiriyahani wuxuu ka tagi karaa faylasha ku-meel-gaarka ah ee xusuusta ku xiran ee MySQL; saamiga hoose meesha kama saarayo isticmaalka saxanka."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Redo-log advice deferred until the observation window is sufficient and Innodb_log_waits is available."
msgstr "Talada redo-log dib baa loo dhigay ilaa daaqadda indha-indheyntu ku filnaato oo Innodb_log_waits la heli karo."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Cumulative Innodb_log_waits: %.0f."
msgstr "Isbiirsiga Innodb_log_waits: %.0f."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Investigate transaction sizes, log-buffer pressure, and storage latency. Recheck the rate under load before considering innodb_log_buffer_size; this historical count is not evidence of a current stall."
msgstr "Baadh cabbirrada macaamilka, cadaadiska kaydka diiwaanka, iyo daahitaanka kaydinta. Dib u hubi heerka inta culays jiro ka hor inta aanad tixgelin innodb_log_buffer_size; tiradan taariikhiga ah ma aha caddeyn joogsi hadda jira."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "InnoDB log-buffer waits"
msgstr "Sugitaanka kaydka diiwaanka InnoDB"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "installed Cacti composer.json"
msgstr "composer.json ee Cacti ee rakiban"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Cacti %s installer requirement"
msgstr "Shuruudda rakibaha Cacti %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "PHP compatibility with installed Cacti"
msgstr "Iswaafajinta PHP iyo Cacti ee rakiban"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Running PHP %s; installed Cacti %s."
msgstr "Waxaa shaqeynaya PHP %s; Cacti ee rakiban %s."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Could not establish Cacti's PHP requirement. Check the installed Cacti composer.json or release documentation; Doctor does not assume compatibility."
msgstr "Lama xaqiijin karin shuruudda PHP ee Cacti. Hubi composer.json ee Cacti ee rakiban ama dukumentiga sii-deynta; Doctor ma maleeyo iswaafajin."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "PHP >= %s and < %s"
msgstr "PHP >= %s iyo < %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "PHP >= %s"
msgstr "PHP >= %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Requires %s (%s). Running PHP meets that requirement."
msgstr "Waxay u baahan tahay %s (%s). PHP-ga shaqeynaya wuxuu buuxiyaa shuruuddaas."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Requires %s (%s). Running PHP does not meet that requirement."
msgstr "Waxay u baahan tahay %s (%s). PHP-ga shaqeynaya ma buuxiyo shuruuddaas."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Detected %s; Doctor requires Cacti 1.2.20 or newer."
msgstr "Waxaa la helay %s; Doctor wuxuu u baahan yahay Cacti 1.2.20 ama ka cusub."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Supported Cacti version"
msgstr "Nooca Cacti ee la taageero"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "PHP upstream security support"
msgstr "Taageerada amniga sare ee PHP"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "This checks the PHP release branch, not whether this patch release is up to date or whether your OS vendor backports fixes. Cacti compatibility is checked separately."
msgstr "Tani waxay hubisaa laanta sii-deynta PHP, ma aha in sii-deyntan hagaajinta ahi ay casri tahay ama in bixiyaha OS-kaagu uu dib u soo celiyo hagaajinaha. Iswaafajinta Cacti si gooni ah ayaa loo hubiyaa."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Running PHP %s; upstream security-support status is unknown or this is a prerelease. Check https://www.php.net/supported-versions.php and update Doctor's support data."
msgstr "Waxaa shaqeynaya PHP %s; xaaladda taageerada amniga sare lama yaqaan ama tani waa sii-deyn horudhac ah. Hubi https://www.php.net/supported-versions.php oo cusboonaysii xogta taageerada ee Doctor."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Running PHP %s; PHP %s receives upstream security fixes through %s."
msgstr "Waxaa shaqeynaya PHP %s; PHP %s wuxuu helaa hagaajinaha amniga sare ilaa %s."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Running PHP %s; PHP %s no longer receives upstream security fixes; support ended %s. Upgrade to a supported PHP branch compatible with your Cacti installation, or confirm security maintenance with your OS vendor."
msgstr "Waxaa shaqeynaya PHP %s; PHP %s mar dambe ma helo hagaajinaha amniga sare; taageeradu waxay dhammaatay %s. U cusboonaysii laan PHP oo la taageero oo la jaanqaada rakibaaddaada Cacti, ama kala xaqiiji dayactirka amniga bixiyaha OS-kaaga."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Required current CLI PHP extensions"
msgstr "Kordhinnada PHP CLI ee hadda loo baahan yahay"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Required web PHP extensions"
msgstr "Kordhinnada PHP web ee loo baahan yahay"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Missing: %s. Install them through the operating system package manager."
msgstr "Maqan: %s. Ku rakib adigoo adeegsanaya maareeyaha xirmooyinka nidaamka hawlgalka."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "All PHP extensions required by the Cacti installer are loaded in this PHP context."
msgstr "Dhammaan kordhinnada PHP ee uu u baahan yahay rakibaha Cacti waxay ku raran yihiin xaaladdan PHP."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Doctor does not execute configured binaries while running as root."
msgstr "Doctor ma fuliyo faylasha fulinta ee la dejiyay inta uu ku shaqeynayo root ahaan."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "The file name %s is not expected for %s, so Doctor did not execute it."
msgstr "Magaca faylka %s looma filayo %s, sidaas darteed Doctor ma fulin."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Doctor is running as root, so permission checks describe root rather than the web server or poller account, configured binaries are not executed, and repairs are refused. Run Doctor as the Cacti poller user."
msgstr "Doctor wuxuu ku shaqeynayaa root ahaan, sidaas darteed hubinta ogolaanshuhu waxay qeexaysaa root halkii ay ka ahaan lahayd server-ka webka ama koontada poller-ka, faylasha fulinta ee la dejiyay lama fuliyo, hagaajintana waa la diiday. Ku shaqaysii Doctor isticmaalaha poller-ka Cacti."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Doctor privileges"
msgstr "Mudnaanta Doctor"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Doctor is running without root privileges."
msgstr "Doctor wuxuu ku shaqeynayaa iyadoo aan lahayn mudnaanta root."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Required CLI PHP extensions"
msgstr "Kordhinnada PHP CLI ee loo baahan yahay"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The configured PHP CLI executable is unavailable, so its extensions cannot be checked."
msgstr "Faylka fulinta PHP CLI ee la dejiyay lama heli karo, sidaas darteed kordhinnadiisa lama hubin karo."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "shell_exec() is disabled, so Doctor cannot compare the CLI PHP extensions with Cacti requirements."
msgstr "shell_exec() waa la naafeeyay, sidaas darteed Doctor ma isbarbardhigi karo kordhinnada CLI PHP iyo shuruudaha Cacti."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The configured PHP CLI executable did not return a valid extension list."
msgstr "Faylka fulinta PHP CLI ee la dejiyay ma soo celin liis kordhin oo ansax ah."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Missing from CLI PHP: %s. The web and CLI PHP configurations are separate on many systems."
msgstr "Ka maqan CLI PHP: %s. Dejinta PHP ee webka iyo CLI way kala gooni yihiin nidaamyo badan."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The configured PHP CLI has every extension required by Cacti."
msgstr "PHP CLI ee la dejiyay wuxuu leeyahay kordhin kasta oo Cacti u baahan tahay."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "GD TrueType support"
msgstr "Taageerada GD TrueType"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Recommended PHP features"
msgstr "Astaamaha PHP ee lagu talinayo"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Unavailable: %s. Cacti can run without these features, but related functionality may be limited."
msgstr "Lama heli karo: %s. Cacti wuu shaqeyn karaa la'aantood, laakiin shaqooyinka la xiriira way xaddidnaan karaan."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The optional gettext, SNMP, and GD TrueType features are available."
msgstr "Astaamaha ikhtiyaariga ah ee gettext, SNMP, iyo GD TrueType waa la heli karaa."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "memory_limit is %s (%dM or more is recommended)"
msgstr "memory_limit waa %s (%dM ama ka badan ayaa lagu talinayaa)"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "max_execution_time is %d seconds (60 or more is recommended)"
msgstr "max_execution_time waa %d ilbiriqsi (60 ama ka badan ayaa lagu talinayaa)"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "date.timezone is not set"
msgstr "date.timezone lama dejin"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "unset"
msgstr "aan la dejin"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s. Current values: %s"
msgstr "%s. Qiimaha hadda: %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "PHP runtime configuration"
msgstr "Dejinta hawlgalka PHP"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Database connection"
msgstr "Isku xirka xog-ururinta"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Query failed: %s"
msgstr "Weydiintu way fashilantay: %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "A read-only query completed successfully."
msgstr "Weydiin akhris-kaliya ah ayaa si guul leh u dhammaatay."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The database returned an unexpected result."
msgstr "Xog-ururintu waxay soo celisay natiijo aan la filayn."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Doctor could not determine the database server version from %s."
msgstr "Doctor wuxuu garan waayay nooca server-ka xog-ururinta ee ka yimid %s."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Supported database server"
msgstr "Server xog-ururin oo la taageero"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s %s detected; this Cacti branch recommends %s %s or newer."
msgstr "%s %s ayaa la helay; laantan Cacti waxay ku talinaysaa %s %s ama ka cusub."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Database character set is %s and collation is %s. Cacti requires utf8mb4."
msgstr "Qaybta xarfaha xog-ururinta waa %s iskuxigxiggana waa %s. Cacti wuxuu u baahan yahay utf8mb4."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "aan la aqoon"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Database character set"
msgstr "Qaybta xarfaha xog-ururinta"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Database timezone support"
msgstr "Taageerada aagga waqtiga ee xog-ururinta"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The Cacti database account cannot read mysql.time_zone_name. Grant SELECT access and populate the database timezone tables."
msgstr "Koontada xog-ururinta Cacti ma akhrin karto mysql.time_zone_name. Sii ogolaansho SELECT oo buuxi jadwallada aagga waqtiga ee xog-ururinta."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "The database timezone table is accessible and contains %d entries."
