#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "Scheduled checks are disabled. Enable them in Settings > Doctor to retain samples and alert on changes."
msgstr "Hubinta jadwalka leh waa la damiyay. Ka shid Dejinta > Doctor si aad u hayso muunadaha oo aad u hesho digniin marka isbeddel dhaco."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
