#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "A completed diagnostic run is recent; this does not mean all checks passed."
msgstr "Orod baaris ah oo dhammaystiran wuu dhacay dhowaan; tani macnaheedu ma aha in dhammaan hubintii gudbeen."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "Doctor alert state is invalid. Restore doctor_alert_pending from backup before retrying."
msgstr "Xaaladda digniinta Doctor waa mid aan sax ahayn. Ka soo celi doctor_alert_pending nuqulka keydka ka hor intaadan isku dayin mar kale."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "Doctor alert transitions are invalid; no email was sent."
msgstr "Isbeddellada digniinta Doctor waa kuwo aan sax ahayn; wax iimayl ah lama dirin."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "Alert delivery"
msgstr "Dirista digniinta"

#: doctor_scheduling.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d check transitions await delivery; attempts: %d of 3."
msgstr "%d isbeddel hubin ayaa sugaya diris; isku dayga: %d ka mid ah 3."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "Automatic retries exhausted. Correct Cacti mail settings, then run Doctor with --scheduled --retry-alerts as the poller user."
msgstr "Isku dayga tooska ah wuu dhammaaday. Sax dejinta iimaylka Cacti, ka dibna ku orod Doctor adigoo adeegsanaya --scheduled --retry-alerts sidii isticmaalaha poller-ka."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
#, php-format
msgid "Next eligible retry: %s UTC, after a primary poller cycle."
msgstr "Isku dayga xiga ee u qalma: %s UTC, ka dib wareegga poller-ka koowaad."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "No alert recipients are currently configured; pending transitions are retained."
msgstr "Ma jiraan qaataayaal digniin oo hadda loo habeeyay; isbeddellada sugaya waa la hayaa."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "No retained alert is awaiting delivery. Mail-server acceptance does not prove inbox delivery."
msgstr "Ma jirto digniin la hayo oo sugaysa diris. Aqoonsiga adeegga iimaylku ma caddeynayo gaaritaanka sanduuqa iimaylka."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "Doctor retained status changes (UTC). Repeated changes for one check are coalesced; an out-and-back transition is retained."
msgstr "Isbeddellada xaaladda ee uu hayo Doctor (UTC). Isbeddellada soo noqnoqda ee hal hubin waa la isku daraa; isbeddelka baxa ee soo laabta waa la hayaa."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: %s -> %s (latest change %s)"
msgstr "%s: %s -> %s (isbeddelkii u dambeeyay %s)"

#: doctor_scheduling.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d further status changes are not listed because the alert queue reached its storage limit."
msgstr "%d isbeddel xaaladeed oo kale lama taxin sababtoo ah safka digniintu wuxuu gaaray xadkiisa kaydinta."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "Open Utilities > Doctor for current measurements, recommended actions, and verification steps."
msgstr "Fur Adeegyada > Doctor si aad u aragto cabbirrada hadda jira, tallaabooyinka lagula taliyay, iyo tillaabooyinka xaqiijinta."

