msgstr "Maalin Kasta"

#: setup.php
msgid "Alert Email Addresses"
msgstr "Cinwaannada Iimaylka Digniinta"

#: setup.php
msgid "Comma-separated addresses to email when a check starts or stops failing. Leave empty to only log changes to the Cacti log."
msgstr "Cinwaannada hakadku kala sooco ee loo diro iimaylka marka hubintu bilowdo ama joojiso fashilka. Banaan ku dhaaf si isbeddellada loogu qoro diiwaanka Cacti oo keliya."

#: setup.php
msgid "Alert on Warnings"
msgstr "Ku ogeysii Digniinaha"

#: setup.php
msgid "Also alert when a check moves into or out of a warning."
msgstr "Sidoo kale ogeysii marka hubin ay gasho ama ka baxdo digniin."

#: setup.php
msgid "Thresholds"
msgstr "Xadadka"

#: setup.php
msgid "Poller Run Time Warning (percent)"
msgstr "Digniinta Waqtiga Shaqada Poller (boqolkiiba)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn when the last main-poller run used this share of the polling interval. Runs that take the whole interval always fail."
msgstr "Digniin bixi marka shaqadii ugu dambeysay ee main-poller ay isticmaasho saamigan ka mid ah muddada polling-ka. Shaqooyinka qaata muddada oo dhan mar walba way fashilmaan."

#: setup.php
msgid "RRA Disk Free Warning (percent)"
msgstr "Digniinta Booska Banaan ee Disk-ga RRA (boqolkiiba)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn when free space on the RRA file system drops below this percentage."
msgstr "Digniin bixi marka booska banaan ee nidaamka faylasha RRA uu ka hoos maro boqolkiibadan."

#: setup.php
msgid "Fail when free space on the RRA file system drops below this percentage."
msgstr "Fashil ku dhawaaq marka booska banaan ee nidaamka faylasha RRA uu ka hoos maro boqolkiibadan."

#: setup.php
msgid "RRA Disk Free Failure (percent)"
msgstr "Fashilka Booska Banaan ee Disk-ga RRA (boqolkiiba)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Clock Drift Warning (seconds)"
msgstr "Digniinta Kala Duwanaanshaha Saacadda (ilbiriqsiyo)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn when the database and PHP clocks differ by more than this."
msgstr "Digniin bixi marka saacadaha kaydka xogta iyo PHP ay ku kala duwanaadaan wax ka badan intan."

#: setup.php
msgid "Clock Drift Failure (seconds)"
msgstr "Fashilka Kala Duwanaanshaha Saacadda (ilbiriqsiyo)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Fail when the database and PHP clocks differ by more than this."
msgstr "Fashil ku dhawaaq marka saacadaha kaydka xogta iyo PHP ay ku kala duwanaadaan wax ka badan intan."

#: setup.php
msgid "RRD Stale Intervals"
msgstr "Muddada Xogta Duugowday ee RRD"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn after this many collection intervals without a file update (1 to 100)."
msgstr "Digniin bixi ka dib tiradan oo ah muddooyinka ururinta iyadoo aan faylka la cusboonaysiin (1 ilaa 100)."

#: setup.php
msgid "Additional disk-write delay for external caching (0 to 86400). Boost adds its own allowance."
msgstr "Dib-u-dhac dheeraad ah oo qorista disk-ga ah oo loogu talagalay kaydinta dibadda (0 ilaa 86400). Boost wuxuu ku daraa oggolaansho u gaar ah."

#: setup.php
msgid "Deferred RRD Write Allowance (seconds)"
msgstr "Oggolaanshaha Dib-u-dhigista Qorista RRD (ilbiriqsiyo)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Cacti Log Size Warning (MB)"
msgstr "Digniinta Cabbirka Diiwaanka Cacti (MB)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn when the Cacti log grows beyond this size, which usually means log rotation is not running."
msgstr "Digniin bixi marka diiwaanka Cacti uu ka weynaado cabbirkan, taas oo badanaa ka dhigan in wareejinta diiwaanku aysan shaqaynayn."
